{"about_the_game":"Welcome to a utopian world of wonders and perfection, in which humans live in harmony with their loyal and fervent robots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668580/extras/fd8587e23f88ccbe039840c97e99a7e6.poster.avif?t=1764675129\" width=612 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668580/extras/fd8587e23f88ccbe039840c97e99a7e6.webm?t=1764675129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668580/extras/fd8587e23f88ccbe039840c97e99a7e6.mp4?t=1764675129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Well, that's how it used to be. With the launch of the latest robot-control system mere days away, only a tragic accident or a global conspiracy could disrupt it\u2026<br><br>The unstoppable course of technology along with secret experiments have brought rise to mutant creatures, terrifying machines and superpowered robots\u2014all suddenly rebelling against their creators. Only you can stop them and find out what lies behind the idealized world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668580/extras/b11fd3722bf23cdc5e2f08b371b38257.poster.avif?t=1764675129\" width=612 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668580/extras/b11fd3722bf23cdc5e2f08b371b38257.webm?t=1764675129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668580/extras/b11fd3722bf23cdc5e2f08b371b38257.mp4?t=1764675129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Using the combat abilities granted by your experimental power glove, your arsenal of blades and cutting-edge weaponry, fight for your life in explosive and frenetic encounters. Adapt your fighting style to each unique opponent. Combine your skills and resources, use the environment and upgrade your equipment to overcome challenges and fight for good.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668580/extras/da42f4152da901d5ad7f219df95c37dd.poster.avif?t=1764675129\" width=612 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668580/extras/da42f4152da901d5ad7f219df95c37dd.webm?t=1764675129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668580/extras/da42f4152da901d5ad7f219df95c37dd.mp4?t=1764675129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2022\tAn utopian world, both mad and sublime<br>\u2022\tVisceral, spectacular and unforgiving combat<br>\u2022\tBlast giant machines and mutants using your multiple skills and advanced weapons<br>\u2022\tUpgrade your arsenal and equipment","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"fbf6ef189b6beb1e0828e3a4909e6a460543e64b.jpg","localized_name":"The Motherland Does Not Forget its Heroes","name":"The Motherland Does Not Forget its Heroes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/668580/fbf6ef189b6beb1e0828e3a4909e6a460543e64b.jpg"},{"icon":"c17fec1e8c4127fff03e587cb7454ee98d0e1cbb.jpg","localized_name":"Strike","name":"Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/668580/c17fec1e8c4127fff03e587cb7454ee98d0e1cbb.jpg"},{"icon":"78e905f4a79e0bf297dbab8fc5ad9b71ad326e06.jpg","localized_name":"Medium Rare","name":"Medium Rare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/668580/78e905f4a79e0bf297dbab8fc5ad9b71ad326e06.jpg"},{"icon":"52be52eb0a3afdba8c9d3a9d9f9f94b3e63ef032.jpg","localized_name":"Make It Go Round","name":"Make It Go Round","path":